## Database

Migrations live in `supabase/migrations/` (or your equivalent). List key migrations:

| Migration | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `<timestamp>_baseline.sql` | Initial schema |
| `<timestamp>_rls.sql` | Row-level security policies |
| ... | ... |

Regenerate types after schema changes:
```bash
npx supabase gen types typescript --project-id <id> > apps/web/src/types/database.types.ts
```

